// another folder.
// References to theorems of other folders: "ent:" (Bézout, unique factorization, continued fractions, quadratic
// reciprocity), "ant:" (quadratic and cyclotomic integers, unit theorems, Stickelberger), "ar:" (modularity, Ribet,
// Mazur, Mordell–Weil, theta transformation, Deligne's bound, prime number theorem), "ca:", "co:" (pigeonhole
// principle, Jacobi triple product), "ana:", "gt:" (Tamagawa number), "rt:" (Ratner); planned folders "la:" (linear
// algebra), "ft:" (field theory), "pr:" (probability), with the ids expected there.
//
// Sources: Hardy and Wright, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers (6th ed. 2008); Ireland and Rosen, A Classical
// Introduction to Modern Number Theory (2nd ed. 1990); Serre, A Course in Arithmetic (1973); Cassels, An Introduction
