// 2013); Conway and Sloane, Sphere Packings, Lattices and Groups (3rd ed. 1999); Schmidt, Diophantine Approximation
// (LNM 785, 1980); Baker, Transcendental Number Theory (1975); Bugeaud, Approximation by Algebraic Numbers (2004);
